Feature:

Background: This executes once per feature file
	Given these properties
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|testray.component.names|Accessibility|
		|testray.main.component.name|User Interface|

Setup: This executes before each scenario 
	Given TestCase set Up Portal Instance
	When User first Login PG

Teardown: This executes after each scenario 
	Given PortalInstances tear Down CP
		|testPortalInstance|TestPropsUtil#get('test.portal.instance')|
Scenario: Smoke
Priority: 3
	Given Page add
		|defaultURL|${defaultURL}|
		|nodePort|${nodePort}|
		|pageName|Test Page1|
		|pageTemplateName|${pageTemplateName}|
		|sitePageType|${pageType}|
	When Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Test Page1|
	And Portlet add PG
		|portletName|Web Content Display|
	And WebContent add PG Via WCD
		|webContentContent|Web Content Content|
		|webContentTitle|Web Content Title|
	And SignOut sign Out
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Test Page1|
	Then AssertAccessible